  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GCRF Gender, Justice and Security Hub</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project facilitates gender justice and inclusive security in conflict affected societies. The hub brings global experts from a range of disciplinary, professional and geographic backgrounds to participate in six major projects. SDG 5, 16</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
